  "headline": "President Prabowo Subianto Bestows National Hero Titles To 19 Figures",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Awards 19 National Hero Titles",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto granted National Hero titles to 19 distinguished figures in a ceremony at the State Palace on National Heroes Day.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto awarded the National Hero title to 19 individuals during a formal ceremony at the State Palace.",
    "The list of recipients includes historical figures such as R.M. Margono Djojohadikusumo, Hoegeng Iman Santoso, and Ali Sadikin.",
    "The ceremony held on November 10 marks the annual national observance of Heroes Day in Indonesia."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 10, 2026, President Prabowo Subianto presided over an official ceremony at the State Palace in Jakarta to honor 19 individuals with the title of National Hero. This event, held in commemoration of National Heroes Day, recognized various figures for their contributions to Indonesia's history, governance, and development. Notable recipients identified in reports include R.M. Margono Djojohadikusumo, a founder of BNI and the president's grandfather; former National Police Chief Hoegeng Iman Santoso; former Jakarta Governor Ali Sadikin; political figure Abdoel Moethalib Sangadji; and economist Frans Seda. The ceremony was attended by various government officials. The conferment serves as a central part of the nation's annual remembrance, with additional regional commemorative activities, such as the Gerak Jalan Perjuangan Mojokerto-Surabaya, occurring concurrently across the country to celebrate these historical contributions.",
